 additional input for a review by the WSDC Board by June 30, 2025. July 1 – December 31, 2024 will be a transition period. Registry Events that (a) occur during this transition period and (b) have published their Champion definition for their WSDC Champion Jack and Jill publicly prior to May 20, 2024 must obtain approval to maintain their previously published definition by the WSDC Board. Events that have not yet published their Champion definition for WSDC Champion Jack and Jill prior to May 20, 2024 or who do not receive Board approval for a variation must follow the definition listed in Section 3.2 #10 ."]]},{"status":"changed","key":"legend-5","old_key":"legend-4","old_version":"2024.2A","sim":0.966,"conf":"medium","t":"note","path":["s-legend"],"moved":true,"diff":[["-","[4]"],["+","[5]"],["=","The points required for moving up (or down) is based on the points in the dancer’s primary role, not the combined points in their primary and secondary roles."]]},{"status":"changed","key":"legend-6","old_key":"legend-5","old_version":"2024.2A","sim":0.963,"conf":"medium","t":"note","path":["s-legend"],"moved":true,"diff":[["-","[5]"],["+","[6]"],["=","Events must follow rule 3.2 #10 for all WSDC Champion J&Js. See footnote for 3.2 #10 for additional details regarding the transition timeframe."]]},{"status":"changed","key":"legend-7","old_key":"legend-6","old_version":"2024.2A","sim":0.975,"conf":"medium","t":"note","path":["s-legend"],"moved":true,"diff":[["-","[6]"],["+","[7]"],["=","Newcomer division is not offered at all events. Competitors may select either Newcomer or Novice divisions, but must dance in Novice once they receive one (1) point in either Newcomer OR Novice in their selected role (primary or secondary)."]]},{"status":"changed","key":"legend-8","old_key":"legend-7","old_version":"2024.2A","sim":0.982,"conf":"medium","t":"note","path":["s-legend"],"moved":true,"diff":[["-","[7]"],["+","[8]"],["=","Registry Events are allowed to waive a competition round if the number of competitors is no more than 10% over the previous Tier’s maximum (e.g., a Tier 4 contest with 43 Followers (and fewer than 39 Leaders) could run a prelims and finals only). This is allowed to provide stability for contest planning."]]},{"status":"changed","key":"legend-9","old_key":"legend-8","old_version":"2024.2A","sim":0.889,"conf":"medium","t":"note","path":["s-legend"],"moved":true,"diff":[["-","[8]"],["+","[9]"],["=","“Numerical” added for clarity, effective March 27, 2024."]]},{"status":"added","key":"legend-1","t":"note","path":["s-legend"],"text":"[1] Clarification added July 11, 2024 ."}]}